.gitignore for the Viv 1.0 repo. Weights, corpora, venvs, binaries and caches stay on disk;
# only source, docs, receipts and manifests are tracked.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.egg-info/

# Virtual environments anywhere in the tree
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/

# Model weights and training binaries
models/
**/*.pt
**/*.gguf
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
**/*.onnx
**/*.npy
**/*.npz

# Toolchain binaries (llama.cpp builds etc.)
tools/

# Large corpora and training data
**/viv_identity_soda.txt
**/viv_soda_dialogue.txt
**/viv_full_training*.txt
**/viv_consolidation.txt
**/viv_safety_training*.txt
**/viv_grammar_corpus.txt

# Learning checkpoints and run output
workspace/autonomy/learning/
workspace/*/learning/

# Databases and local state
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.faiss

# Generated reports and scratch
.opencode/reports/
.opencode/tmp/
**/*.log

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Rust build artifacts anywhere
**/target/

# Stray copies of tool state
**/data/opencode/

# Hardware telemetry dumps
Hardware/

# Generated indexes (rebuildable)
**/foundation_source_index.json
**/target_sources.json

# SQLite sidecar files
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite3-wal
**/*.sqlite3-shm

# Nested checkouts of the repo itself
viv/

# Generated candidate rebuilds (each is a full tree copy)
workspace/aios_rebuild/rebuild_runs/

# Vendored upstream docs
workspace/aios_rebuild/streamlit_core/streamlit_docs/

# Model adapter bases and weights
workspace/swarm_adapters/

# Throwaway proof environments and provider tests
workspace/.hive_proof_env/
.hermes/

# OpenCode tool snapshots and scratch
.opencode/snapshots/
.opencode/tmp/
